#: main.cpp:23
msgid ""
"A program by Eric Bischoff <e.bischoff@noos.fr>\n"
"and John Calhoun.\n"
"\n"
"This program is dedicated to my daughter Sunniva."
msgstr ""
"एरिक बिस्कोफ <e.bischoff@noos.fr> र जोन कलहुनको कार्यक्रम\n"
"।\n"
"\n"
"यो कार्यक्रम मेरो छोरी सुनिभामा समर्पित छ ।"

#: main.cpp:31
msgid "KTuberling"
